    card title "I have"

A: How do you say I have, and I don't have, in Russian? Mostly without a verb: listen to Masha.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name a_cat

B: У меня́ есть кот.
    draw s1

A: Word for word: by me there is a cat. У меня́ is by me, and есть is there is.
    highlight s1_w_1 s1_w_2 s1_w_3 effect underline color #8f887c

A: And кот stays just as it is: after есть, the thing you have keeps its plain form.
    highlight s1_w_4 effect underline color #8f887c

    erase s1 a_cat

    draw talk1

    draw talk1

A: To ask, Masha just raises her voice; да, есть is the short yes.
    highlight talk1_1_words part "у тебя́" effect underline color #8f887c

    erase talk1

A: Each person has its own by-form: я becomes у меня́, and ты becomes у тебя́.
    draw p1 p2

A: About Tom, у него́ есть брат; about Masha, у неё есть кот: after у, он and она́ gain an н.
    draw p3 a_bro p4 a_cat2

A: And the г in него́ is said like в: у него́.
    highlight p3 part него́ effect underline color #8f887c

    erase a_bro a_cat2

    draw p5

B: And polite вы becomes у вас: at (@draw a_cup@) a café, у вас есть ко́фе? Do you have coffee?

    erase pron a_cup

A: Now Tom has come to Masha's for breakfast, and he asks what there is.
    draw b_bread b_cheese parallel true

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw b_milk

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw x_bmilk

A: Did you hear it? Not молоко́, but молока́: after нет, the end of the word changes.
    highlight talk2_4_words part молока́ effect underline color #8f887c

A: Here нет means there is no, and the thing that isn't there takes a new ending.
    highlight talk2_4_words part "[нет] молока́" effect underline color #8f887c

A: Grammar books call it the genitive; think of it as the of-ending: нет молока́ is close to none of milk.
    highlight talk2_4_words part молока́ effect underline color #8f887c

    erase talk2

    draw b_water

    draw talk3

    draw talk3

    draw x_bwater

    pause 0.6

    erase talk3 b_bread b_cheese b_milk x_bmilk b_water x_bwater

    hide speakers

    draw h_est h_net parallel true

A: A he-word in a consonant adds а, and that а isn't a she, it's the of-ending: кот, нет кота́; хлеб, нет хле́ба.
    draw e1 n1 e2 n2 g1

B: A word in а swaps it for ы: вода́, нет воды́.
    draw e3 n3 g2

A: After к or г it's и, as in the plurals: кни́га, нет кни́ги; and я becomes и too: неде́ля, нет неде́ли.
    draw e4 n4 g3 e5 n5 g5

B: And an оно́ word swaps its о for а: молоко́, нет молока́.
    draw e6 n6 g4

    hide board

    draw q_bread x_bread

    quiz "Tom has no bread. У него́ нет ___. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "нет хле́ба" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Хле́ба: a he-word in a consonant adds а after нет.
        wrong: Хле́бе is the ending after в and на, not after нет.
        * хлеб
        + хле́ба
        * хле́бе

    erase q_bread x_bread question_1_stamp

    draw q_water x_water

    ask "Masha has no water. Type the missing word: У неё нет ___." answer ["воды"] reveal.text "нет воды́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Воды́: the а of вода́ becomes ы.
        wrong: Start from вода́; after нет, its last letter changes.

    erase q_water x_water question_2_stamp

    draw q_book x_book

    quiz "Tom says he has no book: У меня́ нет ___. Which is right?" reveal.text "нет кни́ги" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Кни́ги: after г, Russian writes и, never ы.
        wrong: Think of the plurals: which letter never comes after г?
        * кни́га
        * кни́гы
        + кни́ги

    erase q_book x_book question_3_stamp

    draw q_cat

    quiz "Which one says I have a cat?" above q_cat reveal.text "у меня́ есть кот" reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: After есть, the cat keeps its plain form: кот.
        wrong: Есть or нет? And after есть, does the word change?
        + У меня́ есть кот.
        * У меня́ есть кота́.
        * У меня́ нет кота́.

    erase q_cat question_4_stamp

    draw q_coffee x_coffee

    quiz "Masha says she has no coffee: У меня́ нет ___. Which is right?" reveal.text "нет ко́фе" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Ко́фе never changes: like кино́, it has one form for everything.
        wrong: Think of я хочу́ ко́фе: did ко́фе change there?
        + ко́фе
        * ко́фа
        * ко́фы

    erase q_coffee x_coffee question_5_stamp

    group recap members ["r_bread","r_cheese","r_milk","r_cat"]
    mark x_rmilk around r_milk #8f887c kind cross
    parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase recap x_rmilk

    show h_est h_net e1 n1 e2 n2 e3 n3 e4 n4 e5 n5 e6 n6

A: So есть leaves a word alone, and нет reaches into its end.
    highlight h_est h_net effect underline color #8f887c

A: Молоко́ is the milk on the table; молока́, the milk that isn't there.
    highlight e6 n6 effect underline color #8f887c

    hide board

B: And at the market you can now ask: у вас есть ры́ба? Пока́!
    icon end_fish size 160 set twemoji x 500 y 460 or ["tropical fish"] icon_look picture of fish
    text end_say "У вас есть ры́ба?" say "У вас есть ры́ба?" say_voice b x 500 y 290 font_size 64

